1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:04,250
(The first day after Claire was released.)

2
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,180
Now I see... no wonder you’re so good at gardening.

3
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,980
Actually, my dad and I planted all of these together.

4
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,990
Check this out, there are roses here too!

5
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,490
You're such a show-off!

6
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,760
Before my dad got sick,

7
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,840
he taught me how to do so many things.

8
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:51,550
He said

9
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,720
he wanted to make sure I could take care of myself

10
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,640
when he’s no longer around.

11
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:49,650
Don't worry, Dad.

12
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:56,870
I'll take a good care of Bell.

13
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,410
Let’s start taking care of her right here.

14
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:08,800
If you cry this much,

15
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:11,170
you're going to lose your beauty, you know?

16
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,640
You even brought this along?
